# VTID-03881 — commands run for validation

## Root-cause investigation (read-only, before any code change)

- Direct Supabase query on vtid_ledger confirmed VTID-03862's status column
  was still 'in_progress' immediately after the self-healing-reconciler's
  11:36:59 UTC cycle set is_terminal=true/terminal_outcome='failed'.
- Cross-checked gateway logs (aws logs get-log-events, /vitana/gateway log
  group) confirming the exact terminalize log line and timestamp:
  "[self-healing-reconciler] VTID-03862 terminalized failed via autopilot
  execution 37fa35bb (reverted)" at 2026-09-14T11:36:59.600Z.
- Read self-healing-reconciler.ts's success and failure branches side by
  side: success sets status:'completed' in its PATCH body; failure never
  sets status at all.
- grep confirmed 'failed' is already used as a vtid_ledger.status value
  elsewhere (routes/events.ts query filter), so this is not a new enum value.

