## Independent regression caught during this PR's own validation

Running the FULL suite (not just the new/changed test file) surfaced a
pre-existing test failure introduced by PR #3305 (VTID-03880, already
merged): `vtid-03850-staging-executor-dispatch-pinned.test.ts` pinned the
old `DEEPSEEK_SECRET_NAME`/describe-secret shape in
AWS-PROD-DEPLOY-AUTOPILOT-EXECUTOR.yml, which VTID-03880 replaced with a
hardcoded `DEEPSEEK_SECRET_ARN` literal. PR #3305 was workflow-only and was
validated with YAML parsing + `bash -n` on its `run:` blocks, not a full
jest run (VALIDATOR-CHECK.yml's own path triggers don't cover
`.github/workflows/**`). Fixed the test's assertion in this same PR to match
the new, correct shape — this is not a new production behavior change, only
a test fix for an already-live workflow file.

